// 2. Demodulate current line (with correct phase) → U_curr, V_curr
// 3. Demodulate the previous scanline (two texture rows up) → U_prev, V_prev
// 4. Blend at baseband: U_final = mix(U_curr, U_prev), V_final = mix(V_curr, V_prev)
